<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Maze</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2rem auto; color: #111827; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  section { border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  section h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  form { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: .8rem; gap: .15rem; }
  input[type=number] { width: 4rem; }
  img { display: block; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; max-width: 100%; background: #fff; }
  .notice { background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #10b981; padding: .5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .error { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #ef4444; padding: .5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Maze</h1>
<p>Generate or load a maze, solve it with a breadth-first search, or train a Q-learning agent that walks it from any starting point to a fixed end point.</p>

{{if .Notice}}<div class="notice">{{.Notice}}</div>{{end}}
{{if .Error}}<div class="error">{{.Error}}</div>{{end}}

<section>
  <h2>Maze</h2>
  <form method="post" action="/maze/generate">
    <label>Rows <input type="number" name="rows" min="1" max="{{.MaxSize}}" value="10" required></label>
    <label>Columns <input type="number" name="cols" min="1" max="{{.MaxSize}}" value="10" required></label>
    <button type="submit">Generate</button>
  </form>
  <form method="post" action="/maze/load" enctype="multipart/form-data">
    <label>Load file <input type="file" name="file" required></label>
    <button type="submit">Load</button>
  </form>
  <form method="get" action="/maze/save">
    <button type="submit" {{if not .HasMaze}}disabled{{end}}>Save current maze</button>
  </form>
  <img src="/maze/image.png?v={{.ImageVersion}}" alt="maze">
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Solve</h2>
  <form method="post" action="/maze/solve">
    <label>Start row <input type="number" name="start_row" min="1" value="1" required></label>
    <label>Start col <input type="number" name="start_col" min="1" value="1" required></label>
    <label>End row <input type="number" name="end_row" min="1" value="{{.Rows}}" required></label>
    <label>End col <input type="number" name="end_col" min="1" value="{{.Cols}}" required></label>
    <button type="submit" {{if not .HasMaze}}disabled{{end}}>Solve</button>
  </form>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Q-learning agent</h2>
  <p>The agent trains on the maze above for a fixed end point, then can be queried from any start point.</p>
  <form method="post" action="/agent/train">
    <label>End row <input type="number" name="end_row" min="1" value="{{.Rows}}" required></label>
    <label>End col <input type="number" name="end_col" min="1" value="{{.Cols}}" required></label>
    <button type="submit" {{if not .HasMaze}}disabled{{end}}>Train</button>
  </form>
  {{if .HasAgent}}<p>Agent trained for end point (row {{.AgentEndRow}}, col {{.AgentEndCol}}).</p>{{end}}
  <form method="post" action="/agent/run">
    <label>Start row <input type="number" name="start_row" min="1" value="1" required></label>
    <label>Start col <input type="number" name="start_col" min="1" value="1" required></label>
    <button type="submit" {{if not .HasAgent}}disabled{{end}}>Run</button>
  </form>
  <img src="/agent/image.png?v={{.ImageVersion}}" alt="agent route">
</section>

</body>
</html>
